13
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:50,719
Let me tell you,

14
00:00:50,719 --> 00:00:52,479
I have no trouble finding tenants here.

15
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,759
Take it or leave it.

16
00:00:54,119 --> 00:00:54,740
In all my years,

17
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:56,119
I've met all kinds of people,

18
